Deconstructing tuples
You can also deconstruct tuples into separate variables. The deconstructing
declaration has the same syntax as named field tuples, but without a variable name
for the tuple, as shown in the following code:
// store return value in a tuple variable with two fields
(string name, int age) tupleWithNamedFields = GetPerson();
